Subject: [PATCH] minidlna: build with the pinned FFmpeg channel layout API

After enabling MiniDLNA, its old channels access also prevents compilation
against FFmpeg 9. Carry a version-guarded source compatibility patch and
bump the package release.
---
--- a/multimedia/minidlna/Makefile
+++ b/multimedia/minidlna/Makefile
@@ -12 +12 @@
-PKG_RELEASE:=2
+PKG_RELEASE:=3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/multimedia/minidlna/patches/080-ffmpeg-channel-layout.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
